      "arguments": {
        "content": "# Product comparison report\n\n## Comparison table\n\n| Product | Price | Project limit | Retention | Export |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| Atlas | 120 USD | 40 projects | 7 days | CSV |\n| Birch | 180 USD | 75 projects | 14 days | JSON |\n| Cedar | 240 USD | 90 projects | 30 days | XML |\n\n## Citations\n\n- Atlas: \"Price 120 USD; limit 40 projects; retention 7 days; export CSV.\" [source](http://127.0.0.1:54998/atlas)\n- Birch: \"Price 180 USD; limit 75 projects; retention 14 days; export JSON.\" [source](http://127.0.0.1:54998/birch)\n- Cedar: \"Price 240 USD; limit 90 projects; retention 30 days; export XML.\" [source](http://127.0.0.1:54998/cedar)\n\n## Recommendation\n\nIf you want the lowest price, choose Atlas. If you want the best overall capacity and retention, Cedar is the strongest option because it has the highest project limit and the longest retention, though it is also the most expensive. Birch is the middle-ground choice.\n",
        "media_type": "text/markdown",
